<title>SRI LANKA: ACL Plastics nine-month net sharply up.</title>
<headline>ACL Plastics nine-month net sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of ACL Plastics Ltd, for the nine months ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			  9 months 1996	  9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	     125.37	vs	   89.33</p>
<p>    Net profit	    23.15	vs	    4.70</p>
<p>NOTE - ACL Plastics Ltd mainly manufactures cable compound.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
